<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰλαντ-ιαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worth a talent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					27.64
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					23.4.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήματα τ</span>. <i>costing a
				talent</i>, prob. in fee to the physician, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.Com.
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>worth a talent</i>, i.e. <i>possessed of one</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγγυοι τ</span>. giving surety
				<i>to the amount of a talent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1350a19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>weighing a talent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					311b3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθοβόλος τ</span>. an engine
			throwing stones <i>of a talent weight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.41.8
			</span></i> codd.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετροβόλος τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				85.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in which the prize is a talent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					2810.18
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
